    "api": "validateProposePromptAndDataFilling",
    "languages": ["zh-CN"],
    "priority": "P0",
    "tags": ["error-code-mapping", "llm-invocation-failed", "retry-exhausted"],
    "summary": "大模型服务连续两次不可用并耗尽重试后，以 llm.invocation_failed 错误码失败，错误以 _llm 伪槽位保留",
    "context": { "id": "3dbc13b5-bd57-4c2b-b503-24e381b6c8d3", "round": 2, "maxRounds": 5 },
